EJ Kapihe saw Divine already floating because he didn't know how to swim. As said by one of the players, Bahay.
BUT according to Google,  it only takes 5-10 seconds to drown in the Pacific Ocean or body of water. And will take 2   days to weeks  before the body  float in the surface. What is the truth???
They need to do Forensic examination on the bodies of Rene & Divine.
@PiaHontiveros
@Ateneo BlueEagles

@focussagoal9389  “na work shop na” or maybe it just looks that way to you because you already decided what you want to believe.

But seriously, wake up. Not everything online is staged or part of some hidden narrative. Some of you are too quick to believe hearsay and too quick to dismiss actual context.

Be wiser with what you choose to believe. Real people are involved here, not characters in a story. Think before you push or share assumptions like they’re facts.

@shintaro02-z4w  Saan ba nanggaling yung idea na “gusto agad maglaro sa UAAP”? Yung IG story was a tribute, not a demand or statement na parang walang nangyari.

Offering or dedicating a game is a normal way athletes honor someone who passed away—it doesn’t mean disrespect or na minamadali yung laro.

Parang lahat na lang binibigyan ng negative meaning kahit tribute lang naman talaga.

@hitten03 lahat ng comments, nakikisagot ka. 

Sana may time ka din muna mag analyze ng sinabi nila, mag isip mabuti. Simple lang, coaches and staff ang dapat na mapanagot. 

Pag di nag salita hahanapin which is reasonable oo, pero ngayon nagsalita may rason padin para ibash, victims din sila, muntik din sila malunod at kung pumunta sila sa NBI maniniwala ka ba? For sure hindi bonak ka eh

@jessicavaldez682  please do understand. Yung story na naahare nila is base lang po sa experience nila doon they are 20 players di na mn nila ma mention lahat nga name ang namentio  lang po nila is kung sino2x nakikita nila during the incident. Kung nasa actual ka na i think di kana makapag isip exept na isipin mo sarili mo.  Put your foot in their shoe. Everything is not easy. They should not be blame. I think the university po may pananagutan. 

Minsan po we need to put our shoe sa situation for us to understand. We can't understand if kumg ano gusto natin marining yung gusto natin. We need to hear also other stories for us the find the answer kung ANO ba nagyari doon since wala na mn tayo doon.

We listen stories sa FB so we need also to listen their story kasi sila yung nandon eh.

Saang part kaya ng story yung maririnig namin sa podcast na may naghanap kay Rene? 

Kasi yes, hinahanap nila si Divine ng ilang beses. Pero nung si Rene may naghanap?

 @jeeeyd
